{"id":"716414197","kind":"article","title":"对比数学与电子游戏","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Video_games_comparison_to_math"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Issawiki & Learning","date":"2024-08-28","updated":"2024-08-28","votes":16,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":268,"keywords":["数学教育","电子游戏","可探索媒介","组合爆炸","工作记忆","教学设计"],"summary":"这条简短的比较笔记列出数学与电子游戏媒介的差异：游戏对象有限且可即时探索，数学却有组合爆炸、需要把问题情境保持在工作记忆中，概念对象还可能有不同心理表征。作者以数学教材、可探索解释、视频课程和间隔重复等媒介作对照，并提出面向数学的游戏化解释工具设想。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/716414197","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"链接到本文"}],"html":"<ul><li data-pid=\"Z9Jy_oiz\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Video_games_work_with_finite_and_discrete_objects\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">电子游戏使用有限且离散对象</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"ksu346lN\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Combinatorial_explosion_in_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学中的组合爆炸</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"hLqunDNd\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Video_games_allow_immediate_exploration\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">电子游戏允许即时的探索</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>，而<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Tinkering_in_math_requires_loading_the_situation_into_working_memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学探索需要将问题情境加载到工作记忆</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"gBqLM9Lw\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Different_mental_representations_of_mathematical_objects_is_a_blocker_for_an_exploratory_medium_of_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学概念有不同的心理表征，这对于制作数学探索媒介是个挑战</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"2dA6BcuY\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Braid_for_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">面向数学的《时空幻境》</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"2skyu1GJ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Duolingo_for_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">面向数学的多邻国</a><br/> </li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-1\">链接到本文</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"cBIpQjwz\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Finiteness_assumption_in_explorable_media\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">可探索媒介中的有限性假设</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"NODwLnRC\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Explorable_explanation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">可探索的解释</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"BfyCIXBZ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Combinatorial_explosion_in_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学中的组合爆炸</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup></li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"7hMvj0sR\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 claude-3.5-sonnet 、校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Video_games_comparison_to_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Video games comparison to math</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 数学中的组合爆炸 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"658395407\" href=\"#/post/658395407\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回